  "full": "historical P8c learner view (178 train + 12 validation relabelled train; P8c test excluded) + P10a 14 (disclosed development) + P10b train roots",
  "selection": "P10b validation roots only",
  "short": "length-extrapolation copies: same sources minus every candidate with > 2 moves and every H10 root"
 },
